  <h2>The contract: where most construction projects go wrong in Lucknow</h2>

  <p>A weak contract is the root cause of most construction disputes in Lucknow. Verbal agreements about materials get forgotten. Payment schedules shift without documentation. Finishing specifications are "understood" rather than written. And when things go sideways, which they occasionally do on any construction project, there is nothing to refer back to.</p>

  <p>The best construction company in Lucknow will give you a contract that includes a full Bill of Quantities with material grades and brands, a milestone-based payment schedule with specific completion criteria, a construction timeline with defined stages and buffer allowances, written warranty terms covering the structure, waterproofing, plumbing, and electrical systems, and a clear dispute resolution mechanism.</p>

  <p>If any of these elements are missing from the contract you're reviewing, ask for them to be added. A company that refuses to add them is telling you something about how they expect the project to go. For comparison, you can read how strong builders handle contracts in our article on <a href="/blog/best-builders-in-lucknow/">the best builders in Lucknow</a>.</p>

